  "name": "Blood Feast",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/RedFaith_Path_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You gorge yourself on the blood of your foes.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, whenever you inflict <strong>Damage</strong> to a living creature with blood, you regain <strong>Stamina</strong> equal to half the <strong>Damage</strong> dealt (minimum of <strong>1</strong>).</p><p>If you <strong>Damage</strong> a swarm, you recover <strong>Stamina</strong> equal to the <strong>Damage</strong> dealt.</p><p>You may spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> at the start of your turn to sustain this effect.</p>",
